Pleasant little bushes grow around the spring-fed lake.	悅目的小灌木叢，生長在這座湧泉湖的四周。
These rocks must lead to some sort of underground spring.  You remind yourself to explore their nooks and crannies sometime...when you don't have so much work to do!	這些岩石想必通往某種地下泉水。你提醒自己，改天要找時間探索這些犄角旮旯……等你沒這麼多事要忙的時候！
Graceful willows adorn the lake.	優雅的柳樹點綴著這座湖泊。
A small, ordinary tree juts up from between the rocks.	一棵普通的小樹，從岩石縫間探出頭來。
The underbrush around the trees is home to many small furry creatures, none of which concern you at the moment.	樹叢間的灌木叢裡，住著許多毛茸茸的小動物，目前都與你無關。
Small bushes thrive by the clear little lake.	小灌木叢在這座清澈的小湖旁茁壯生長。
fairy godmother	教母
You see lush plants and bushes throughout the Kingdom of Daventry.	你看見戴凡確王國各處生長著茂盛的植物與灌木叢。
Many beautiful trees adorn the green countryside.	許多美麗的樹木點綴著這片綠意盎然的鄉間。
This is the goat's trough, currently empty.  Goats are always hungry!	這是山羊的食槽，目前是空的。山羊總是餓著肚子！
There are numerous beautiful trees ringing the goat pen.	山羊圈四周環繞著許多美麗的樹木。
There are many small decorative bushes scattered around Daventry.	戴凡確王國各處散布著許多裝飾用的小灌木叢。
Beautiful shade trees abound in this part of Daventry.	這片戴凡確的土地上，到處都是美麗的遮蔭樹。
This is typical of the large, leafy vegetation found all throughout Daventry.	這是戴凡確王國隨處可見的典型茂密植物。
bush on well	井邊的灌木叢
Several unremarkable plants have rooted themselves at the base of the old stone well.	幾株不起眼的植物，在這座古老石井的底部扎了根。
This is one of the countless rocks and boulders that dot the countryside.	這是散布在鄉間無數石頭與巨石中的一顆。
How many times have you been told not to wolf down your food?	別人跟你說過多少次，吃東西不要狼吞虎嚥？
All sorts of gorgeous trees dot the Daventry countryside.	戴凡確的鄉間點綴著各式各樣美麗的樹木。
This is the largest oak tree you've ever seen.  Its trunk seems to be about ten feet around, and the thick, sturdy branches look like they could hold many times your weight.	這是你見過最大的一棵橡樹。它的樹幹看起來約有十呎粗，粗壯結實的枝幹似乎能承受你體重的許多倍。
The roots of the colossal oak tree are entwined among the rocks.	這棵巨大橡樹的根，交纏在岩石之間。
A small thicket of unimpressive white birch trees grows here.	這裡長著一小叢平凡無奇的白樺樹。
There are plenty of rocks around the base of the enormous tree.	這棵巨樹的樹底四周有不少岩石。
Lovely trees grow near the carrot patch.	可愛的樹木生長在胡蘿蔔田附近。
A copse of low bushes grows beneath the shade trees.	遮蔭樹下長著一叢低矮的灌木。
A patch of pretty flowers has been planted near the garden, just for decoration.	花園附近種著一片美麗的花朵，純粹作為裝飾。
Some low, lush green bushes are growing at the base of the trees.	幾株低矮茂密的翠綠灌木，長在樹底下。
Your attempt at cliffdiving was a smashing failure.	你這次跳崖的嘗試，摔了個粉身碎骨。
Treacherous cliffs surround a picturesque mountain lake.	險峻的懸崖環繞著這座風景如畫的高山湖泊。
The clear mountain lake is surrounded by steep cliffs.	這座清澈的高山湖泊四周，是陡峭的懸崖。
A large, jagged boulder sits at the top of the cliff.	懸崖頂端有一塊巨大嶙峋的岩石。
After swimming for a long time, your strength ebbs and your arms and legs grow weary.  As your life swims before your eyes, you decide to...	游了好長一段時間後，你體力漸漸耗盡，四肢也開始疲憊。就在你的一生在眼前浮現時，你決定……
You splash around for awhile, but unfortunately that won't keep your head above water.  As you go down for the third time, a sense of peace washes over you...	你撲騰了好一陣子，但這樣終究無法讓你的頭浮出水面。當你第三次沉下去時，一股平靜感湧上心頭……
A spreading tree is silhouetted against the sun.	一棵枝葉繁茂的樹，在陽光下映出剪影。
These are the foothills of a large mountain that towers above Daventry.	這裡是聳立在戴凡確王國上方那座大山的山麓。
Small bushes like this one thrive near the fresh lake water.	像這樣的小灌木叢，在清新的湖水旁茁壯生長。
This is a miniature shade tree, which gives shade to the squirrels and other woodland creatures.	這是一棵迷你的遮蔭樹，為松鼠和其他林間生物提供遮蔭。
Long, low bushes grow unbounded throughout Daventry.	又長又矮的灌木叢，在戴凡確各處恣意生長。
These are the foothills of a large mountain which overlooks the Daventry countryside.	這裡是俯瞰著戴凡確鄉間那座大山的山麓。
Over the years, many ordinary rocks like this one have tumbled down from the heights of Daventry's mountain.	多年來，許多像這樣的普通石頭，從戴凡確山上的高處滾落下來。
Many evergreens surround this pretty lake.	許多常綠樹環繞著這座美麗的湖泊。
The water of this crystal clear lake is especially cold and crisp. The Leprechauns use it to brew their dandelion wine.	這座湖水晶瑩剔透，格外冰涼清爽。地穴人用它來釀造蒲公英酒。
Large, lush, colorful bushes grow all about this little lake.	這座小湖四周，長滿了茂盛而色彩繽紛的大灌木叢。
9jxra	9jxra
This is one of many uninteresting rocks that pepper the forest floor.	這是散布在森林地面上眾多平凡石頭中的一顆。
These trees are grotesquely bent and twisted, and the branches seem like they're reaching out to grab you.	這些樹木扭曲變形得十分怪異，枝幹彷彿正伸手要抓住你。
Bushes and vines grow in a jumble throughout this part of the forest.	這片森林裡，灌木叢與藤蔓雜亂地纏生在一起。
This is one of the many small trees scattered around the lovely Daventry countryside.	這是散布在戴凡確美麗鄉間眾多小樹中的一棵。
The trees are somewhat sparse here at the foot of the rocky mountain.	在這座石山腳下，樹木顯得有些稀疏。
rocky hill	岩石山丘
This jagged rocky hill reveals the entrance to a cave.	這座嶙峋的岩石山丘，露出一個洞穴的入口。
Many large rocks and boulders are strewn about the area.	這一帶散落著許多大石頭與巨石。
Two large boulders protect the delicate flowers by the lake.	兩塊巨石守護著湖邊的嬌嫩花朵。
This peaceful little lake is ringed with lovely trees.	這座寧靜的小湖，四周環繞著可愛的樹木。
This is another unremarkable specimen of the hundreds of bushes in Daventry's forests.	這是戴凡確森林裡數百株灌木中，又一株平凡無奇的樣本。
Small plants and bushes grow in the cracks and crevices of this boulder.	小型植物與灌木，從這塊巨石的裂縫中生長出來。
There are some beautiful, fragile little flowers here by the rocks.	岩石旁有幾朵美麗而嬌弱的小花。
clover patch	幸運草叢
Lovely fruit trees have blossomed early this year.	可愛的果樹今年開花得特別早。
three-leaf clover	三葉幸運草
The clover patch is thick with small three-leaf clovers.	這片幸運草叢裡，長滿了密密麻麻的三葉幸運草。
Graceful trees grow in profusion all throughout Daventry.	優雅的樹木在戴凡確各處茂密生長。
A small ordinary bush flourishes in the shade of the trees.	一株普通的小灌木，在樹蔭下欣欣向榮。
This mighty beanstalk stretches up so high, it vanishes into the clouds above.	這株雄偉的豆莖向上延伸得極高，一路沒入天上的雲層之中。
bush and rock	灌木叢與岩石
A commonplace little bush has grown in the protective shade of the rock.	一株平凡的小灌木，在岩石的庇蔭下生長。
There are more bushes in Daventry than you care to notice.	戴凡確的灌木叢多得讓你懶得細看。
The current of this wildly raging river is even more treacherous than it looks.	這條狂暴河流的水流，比看起來還要更加凶險。
The river bank drops off sharply here.  Best to watch your step.	這裡的河岸陡然下陷，最好走路小心一點。
A rough-hewn plank bridge spans the deep rushing river below.	一座粗糙的木板橋，橫跨在下方湍急的深河之上。
Troll	矮精靈
The steep banks are high above the river.	陡峭的河岸高高聳立在河面之上。
This appears to be an oversized Dwarf Maple tree.	這看起來是一棵過度巨大的矮楓樹。
This is the smallest Giant Redwood tree you've ever seen!	這是你見過最小的一棵巨紅杉！
This is just one of the countless bushes and shrubs scattered throughout the beautiful Daventry countryside.	這只是散布在戴凡確美麗鄉間，無數灌木與矮樹叢中的一株。
This is one of the oldest, grandest trees in all of Daventry, though it holds no secrets for you, Sir Graham.	這是戴凡確王國裡最古老、最雄偉的樹木之一，不過格拉漢爵士，它對你沒有任何秘密可言。
This is one of the oldest, grandest trees in all of Daventry.	這是戴凡確王國裡最古老、最雄偉的樹木之一。
baby bird	雛鳥
bird's nest	鳥巢
A couple of bushes lie among the undergrowth of the forest floor.	幾株灌木叢，藏身在森林地面的矮叢之中。
bush by tree	樹旁的灌木叢
You can hardly see the forest for all the trees here!	這裡樹木多得讓你幾乎看不見整片森林！
gingerbread boy	薑餅人
These little gingerbread boys and girls look almost alive! How do you suppose they got here?	這些小小的薑餅人男孩女孩，看起來幾乎像活的一樣！你猜他們是怎麼跑到這裡來的？
candy canes	糖果枴杖
The path to the gingerbread house is lined with the biggest, most tempting candy canes you've ever seen.	通往薑餅屋的小徑兩旁，排列著你見過最大、最誘人的糖果枴杖。
candy_canes	candy_canes
candy_canes1	candy_canes1
candy_canes2	candy_canes2
candy_canes3	candy_canes3
candy_canes4	candy_canes4
candy_canes5	candy_canes5
Even the chimney looks delicious.	就連煙囪看起來都很美味。
Twisted, malformed trees overhang the gingerbread house. They almost seem to reach out for you.	扭曲畸形的樹木，籠罩在薑餅屋上方，彷彿正伸手要抓住你。
This is the most marvelous house you've ever seen! It seems like it's made out of a huge gingerbread cupcake, with frosting for a roof. The chimney is made of gummy bricks, the door and fence are made of candy canes, and sourball stones and gumdrops are scattered around the yard.	這是你見過最神奇的房子！它看起來像是用一個巨大的薑餅杯子蛋糕做成的，屋頂是糖霜。煙囪是用軟糖磚塊砌成，門和柵欄是用糖果枴杖做的，院子裡則散落著酸球石頭和軟糖。
The steps look like they're made out of vanilla fudge, but after years of being stepped on, they've gotten a wee bit filthy.	台階看起來是用香草牛奶糖做的，但多年來被踩踏之下，已經有點髒了。
The roof looks like it's made out of rich vanilla buttercream frosting!	屋頂看起來是用濃郁的香草奶油糖霜做的！
There's a small window at the back of the cupcake...er, the house.  But you can't see through the sugar-pane glass.	這個杯子蛋糕……呃，房子的後方有一扇小窗，但你看不透那扇糖霜玻璃窗。
In this part of the forest the trees are twisted and misshapen lending an eerie feel to the place.	這片森林裡的樹木扭曲變形，讓這地方顯得陰森詭異。
Even the rocks in this part of the forest seem more jagged and unfriendly.  Watch your step, they're everywhere!	就連這片森林裡的岩石，看起來都更嶙峋、更不友善。小心腳步，它們無所不在！
walnut tree	胡桃樹
This large, healthy tree is chock full of plump walnuts.	這棵高大健壯的樹上，結滿了飽滿的胡桃。
These are just two garden-variety pine trees, with nothing to offer but shade.	這只是兩棵普通的松樹，除了遮蔭之外沒有別的用處。
pine tree	松樹
There's nothing particularly interesting about this old gray tree.	這棵灰撲撲的老樹沒什麼特別有趣的地方。
small bush	小灌木叢
Some typical Daventry bushes flourish in the shade of the nearby walnut tree.	幾株典型的戴凡確灌木，在附近胡桃樹的樹蔭下欣欣向榮。
There are trees growing nearly everywhere you look in Daventry.	在戴凡確，幾乎你目光所及之處都長著樹木。
Flourishing pine trees abound in this part of the forest.	這片森林裡，茂盛的松樹隨處可見。
You see a dazzling spray of tiny red flowers.	你看見一叢耀眼的鮮紅小花。
There are an endless variety of trees in Daventry; none of the ones you can see here seem the least bit unusual.	戴凡確的樹木種類繁多，不過你在這裡看到的這幾棵，一點也不特別。
The banks of the swiftly flowing river are steep.	這條湍急河流的河岸十分陡峭。
The river flows swiftly between steep banks.	河水在陡峭的兩岸之間湍急流動。
A large, run-of-the-mill boulder sits nearby.	附近有一塊平凡無奇的大石頭。
Small bushes grow vigorously in this sunny patch of forest.	小灌木叢在這片陽光充足的林地裡茂盛生長。
Bushes and rocks seem to complement each other, don't they?	灌木叢和岩石似乎相得益彰，不是嗎？
There certainly is an abundance of healthy plant life here.	這裡確實有著豐富茂盛的植物生態。
There's nothing unusual about this tree, though it does seem especially healthy.	這棵樹沒什麼特別之處，不過看起來格外健壯。
This is a raging river, filled with massive boulders and treacherous whitewater rapids.	這是一條奔騰的河流，裡頭滿是巨大的岩石與凶險的白浪激流。
It is a massive boulder that splits the river.	這是一塊將河流一分為二的巨石。
Several lovely trees sway peacefully in the breeze.	幾棵可愛的樹木，在微風中安詳地搖曳。
The bushes here grow well, helped by the refreshing spray of the nearby river.	這裡的灌木叢長得很好，多虧了附近河流帶來的清涼水花。
Several large, rough rocks sit around the riverbank.	河岸邊散落著幾塊粗糙的大石頭。
The river is dangerous and powerful.	這條河流既危險又湍急。
The banks of the river are tall and steep.  If you fell down, you'd never be able to climb back up again.	河岸又高又陡，你要是摔下去，恐怕再也爬不上來了。
A few oak trees serenely overlook the turbulent river below.	幾棵橡樹靜靜地俯瞰著下方洶湧的河流。
Low bushes are growing in abundance in the clean Daventry air.	在戴凡確清新的空氣裡，低矮的灌木叢繁茂生長。
These small twisted trees make the area seem very strange.	這些扭曲的小樹，讓這一帶顯得十分怪異。
The plants don't seem to grow very well in this part of the forest.	這片森林裡的植物似乎長得不太好。
All sorts of trees are growing in this part of the forest.	這片森林裡生長著各式各樣的樹木。
